WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.214
Start a new empty notebook. (3× speed)

00:00:00.214 --> 00:00:00.551
Upload the workshop book as the source. (3× speed)

00:00:00.551 --> 00:00:01.612
The workshop book is being indexed. (3× speed)

00:00:01.612 --> 00:00:01.972
Widen the answer to be saved as a note. (3× speed)

00:00:01.972 --> 00:00:04.640
Write the source-grounded request. (3× speed)

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.747
Read the complete request.

00:00:06.747 --> 00:00:07.023
Send the question with the selected book. (3× speed)

00:00:07.023 --> 00:00:07.621
Generate the answer from the selected source. (4× speed)

00:00:07.621 --> 00:00:13.440
Read the answer and its complete definition example.

00:00:13.440 --> 00:00:13.571
Save the checked answer as a reusable note.

00:00:13.571 --> 00:00:15.130
Save this answer as a note

00:00:15.130 --> 00:00:20.220
Read the saved note and its retained citations.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:24.341
Read the note’s example and inspect the reuse control.

00:00:24.341 --> 00:00:24.344
Export the checked result.

00:00:24.344 --> 00:00:24.863
Return to the checked answer for its native copy export.

00:00:24.863 --> 00:00:25.796
Return from the saved note

00:00:25.796 --> 00:00:28.383
Widen the checked answer

00:00:28.383 --> 00:00:30.633
Export the checked result.
